# Witness: a corpus that has stopped quoting the trimmed image size

The suite reported 262 tests passed, of which 97 architecture tests and 165 behavioural tests,
and the fixtures host publishes and runs as a Native AOT binary of 1,557,288 bytes. The trimmed
size is the figure that has gone - and it is the one figure of the four that had no
anti-deletion guard at all, so nothing forced the corpus to keep quoting it correctly, or at
all, once it had been reworded.
